{
  "about": "Settings › Files › Edit layout: which layouts are valid, the error each invalid one gets (PUT /api/settings → 422 invalid_layout, details.reason), and the Spytify --set values a valid one maps to.",
  "generator": {
    "script": "contracts/vectors/generate.py",
    "how": "expected = validate_layout and spytify_settings in generate.py, which encode the rules below. Cases get a 'spytify' block only when the file is generated with --go: Spytify 2.0.2's own code, run by tools/spytify_vectors_test.go, gives 'accepts' (settings.Def.Coerce on every mapped --set value), 'template_error' (Coerce's error for an invalid layout's file name) and 'examples' (naming.Build + naming.FileName for sample_tracks, counter 1, extension m4a). Check mode recomputes 'expected' only.",
    "regenerate": "python3 contracts/vectors/generate.py --write --go <spytify-2.0.2-src>"
  },
  "rules": [
    "Split the pattern at its last '/': the folder part before it, the file name after it. No '/' means no folder.",
    "Validation runs these checks in order and reports the first that fails:",
    "unknown_placeholder: web-ui.md: only {album_artist}, {artists}, {title}, {album}, {track} and {year} are accepted. Spytify's old name {artist} is refused too. details.placeholder names the first one.",
    "stray_brace: extra: a { or } that isn't part of a placeholder. Spytify would keep it as text; refused as a likely typo.",
    "backslash: extra: Spytify refuses a template with \\ ('folders come from output.group_by').",
    "control_character: extra: no control character (U+0000 to U+001F, or U+007F). A NUL can't be passed in --set at all (the recorder would never start), and Spytify would drop the others from the name anyway.",
    "bad_folder: web-ui.md: the folder part, before the last /, must be none, {album_artist} or {album_artist}/{album}, exactly.",
    "empty_file_name: web-ui.md: the file name, after the last /, can't be empty or only spaces.",
    "no_placeholder: extra: Spytify refuses a template with no placeholder; {year} alone doesn't count, since it's always empty on Linux.",
    "Mapping: folder none → output.group_by=none; {album_artist} → artist; {album_artist}/{album} → artist/album. output.template = the file name, unchanged. prefix none/counter/track_number → output.prefix none/counter/album_track. underscores → output.underscores. strip_accents → output.ascii_filenames.",
    "Spytify's naming then: {track} is two digits and empty without a number; {year} is empty (none on Linux); empty () is dropped and the name trimmed of ' -_'; characters / \\ : * ? \" < > | and controls are removed; the album folder gets ' (YYYY)' only if the player sends a year.",
    "The counter prefix is three digits ('001 ') and continues across items (Spytify's output.counter_next)."
  ],
  "extra_rules_note": "stray_brace, backslash, control_character and no_placeholder go beyond web-ui.md's first list; web-ui.md § Edit layout modal now lists them. They're the cautious reading: backslash and no_placeholder would make Spytify refuse its settings at the start of every item (exit 2), and a NUL can't be passed to the recorder at all.",
  "sample_tracks": {
    "elsewhere": {
      "artists": [
        "fakename"
      ],
      "album_artists": [
        "fakename"
      ],
      "title": "Last Hours",
      "album": "Elsewhere",
      "track_number": 5,
      "year": 0
    },
    "collaboration": {
      "artists": [
        "Erik Satie",
        "Olga Scheps"
      ],
      "album_artists": [
        "Erik Satie"
      ],
      "title": "Cinq Grimaces pour le songe d'une nuit d'été: IV. Fanfaronnade",
      "album": "Satie: Gymnopédies",
      "track_number": 10,
      "year": 0
    },
    "no-number": {
      "artists": [
        "fakename"
      ],
      "album_artists": [
        "fakename"
      ],
      "title": "No Number",
      "album": "Singles",
      "track_number": 0,
      "year": 0
    }
  },
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "default",
      "layout": {
        "pattern": "{album_artist}/{album}/{track} - {title}",
        "prefix": "none",
        "underscores": false,
        "strip_accents": false
      },
      "note": "The default layout.",
      "expected": {
        "valid": true,
        "spytify_settings": {
          "output.group_by": "artist/album",
          "output.template": "{track} - {title}",
          "output.prefix": "none",
          "output.underscores": false,
          "output.ascii_filenames": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "default-track-number-prefix",
      "layout": {
        "pattern": "{album_artist}/{album}/{title}",
        "prefix": "track_number",
        "underscores": false,
        "strip_accents": false
      },
      "note": "Prefix 'Album track number' maps to Spytify's album_track.",
      "expected": {
        "valid": true,
        "spytify_settings": {
          "output.group_by": "artist/album",
          "output.template": "{title}",
          "output.prefix": "album_track",
          "output.underscores": false,
          "output.ascii_filenames": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "artist-folder-counter",
      "layout": {
        "pattern": "{album_artist}/{title}",
        "prefix": "counter",
        "underscores": false,
        "strip_accents": false
      },
      "note": "One folder per artist; a three-digit counter before the name.",
      "expected": {
        "valid": true,
        "spytify_settings": {
          "output.group_by": "artist",
          "output.template": "{title}",
          "output.prefix": "counter",
          "output.underscores": false,
          "output.ascii_filenames": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "no-folder",
      "layout": {
        "pattern": "{artists} - {title}",
        "prefix": "none",
        "underscores": false,
        "strip_accents": false
      },
      "note": "No folder: every file in the music folder's root.",
      "expected": {
        "valid": true,
        "spytify_settings": {
          "output.group_by": "none",
          "output.template": "{artists} - {title}",
          "output.prefix": "none",
          "output.underscores": false,
          "output.ascii_filenames": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "underscores",
      "layout": {
        "pattern": "{album_artist}/{album}/{track} - {title}",
        "prefix": "none",
        "underscores": true,
        "strip_accents": false
      },
      "note": "Spaces become underscores in folders and names.",
      "expected": {
        "valid": true,
        "spytify_settings": {
          "output.group_by": "artist/album",
          "output.template": "{track} - {title}",
          "output.prefix": "none",
          "output.underscores": true,
          "output.ascii_filenames": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "strip-accents",
      "layout": {
        "pattern": "{album_artist}/{album}/{track} - {title}",
        "prefix": "none",
        "underscores": false,
        "strip_accents": true
      },
      "note": "Accents are removed from folders and names.",
      "expected": {
        "valid": true,
        "spytify_settings": {
          "output.group_by": "artist/album",
          "output.template": "{track} - {title}",
          "output.prefix": "none",
          "output.underscores": false,
          "output.ascii_filenames": true
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "old-prototype-naming",
      "layout": {
        "pattern": "{album_artist}/{album}/{album_artist} - {title}",
        "prefix": "none",
        "underscores": false,
        "strip_accents": false
      },
      "note": "The prototype's first naming.",
      "expected": {
        "valid": true,
        "spytify_settings": {
          "output.group_by": "artist/album",
          "output.template": "{album_artist} - {title}",
          "output.prefix": "none",
          "output.underscores": false,
          "output.ascii_filenames": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "year-empty",
      "layout": {
        "pattern": "{album_artist}/{album}/{title} ({year})",
        "prefix": "none",
        "underscores": false,
        "strip_accents": false
      },
      "note": "{year} is always empty on Linux, and Spytify drops the empty ().",
      "expected": {
        "valid": true,
        "spytify_settings": {
          "output.group_by": "artist/album",
          "output.template": "{title} ({year})",
          "output.prefix": "none",
          "output.underscores": false,
          "output.ascii_filenames": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "trailing-space",
      "layout": {
        "pattern": "{album_artist}/{album}/{track} - {title} ",
        "prefix": "none",
        "underscores": false,
        "strip_accents": false
      },
      "note": "Spytify trims the expanded name.",
      "expected": {
        "valid": true,
        "spytify_settings": {
          "output.group_by": "artist/album",
          "output.template": "{track} - {title} ",
          "output.prefix": "none",
          "output.underscores": false,
          "output.ascii_filenames": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "album-in-name",
      "layout": {
        "pattern": "{album} - {track} - {title}",
        "prefix": "none",
        "underscores": false,
        "strip_accents": false
      },
      "note": "{album} can be used in the file name.",
      "expected": {
        "valid": true,
        "spytify_settings": {
          "output.group_by": "none",
          "output.template": "{album} - {track} - {title}",
          "output.prefix": "none",
          "output.underscores": false,
          "output.ascii_filenames": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "unknown-genre",
      "layout": {
        "pattern": "{album_artist}/{genre}",
        "prefix": "none",
        "underscores": false,
        "strip_accents": false
      },
      "expected": {
        "valid": false,
        "reason": "unknown_placeholder",
        "placeholder": "{genre}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "unknown-capitalised",
      "layout": {
        "pattern": "{album_artist}/{album}/{Title}",
        "prefix": "none",
        "underscores": false,
        "strip_accents": false
      },
      "note": "Placeholders are case-sensitive.",
      "expected": {
        "valid": false,
        "reason": "unknown_placeholder",
        "placeholder": "{Title}"
      }
    },
